{"ID":"20240314091946-ose1u4t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091946-ose1u4t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091946-ose1u4t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164224-582wwoq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164224-ppeeomr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164224-ppeeomr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:37,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:37\u0026#125;","title":"【防己茯苓汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164224-582wwoq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-582wwoq","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皮水为病，四肢肿，水气在皮肤中，四肢聂聂动者，防己茯苓汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-m4sjlre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-m4sjlre","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"防己茯苓汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-xbkdbtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-xbkdbtf","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己、黄芪、桂枝各三两，茯苓六两，甘草二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-yx4i3fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-yx4i3fh","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"上五味，以水六升，煮取二升，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-cta636n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-cta636n","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们刚刚介绍的是风水，风水是水病刚开始的时候发生就可以看到风水，就两个症状。皮水呢，就是风水没有治好，你来不及开防己黄芪汤，也不会开越婢汤，病往里面走了一点，就叫做皮水。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-jp1ujr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-jp1ujr8","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 225px;","style":"width: 215px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240407103950-ax7nnpi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 215px;\" parent-style=\"width: 225px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-d08ctxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-d08ctxs","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个皮水呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四肢肿，水气在皮肤中，四肢聂聂动者，防己茯苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是水累积在肌肉里面的情形。如果累积在皮肤下面，皮层的下方的时候，就是我们刚才介绍的皮水，但这个是皮层下方已经没有了，在四肢聂聂动者，防己茯苓汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是单纯在...可以说在三焦淋巴系统里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当水在三焦淋巴系统里面的时候，好，诸位看，我们防己呢，刚刚把白术拿掉，变成桂枝跟茯苓，为什么要桂枝跟茯苓，桂枝是行阳的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），除了行全身的阳以外，把心火导入小肠里面也是要靠桂枝。那茯苓呢能够在三焦里面产生油膜，所以说茯苓能够利水。这个如果水跑到三焦油膜里面，跑到肌肉里面的时候，这个时候手和肌肉“四肢聂聂动”，并不是手在抖啊，手会抖，但最主要是肌肉也跟着动，所以我遇到帕金森的时候，帕金森氏症的时候一摸他的肌肉，他的肌肉在跳，这个病人没有办法自主，就是肌肉在那边动，就是防己茯苓汤来加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-o12ejgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-o12ejgs","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在风水的时候，初症的时候没有渴，病比较久的时候，病人都会渴，所以从当你当进入皮水以后呢，就出现渴症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，待会儿我们还会回头再介绍给诸位。这个病人一定会有渴，那防己茯苓汤的处方呢，你看：防己、黄芪、桂枝等量，重用茯苓把水从肌肉里面利掉。那有的人呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"像病人有尿毒，我们也会用到这个这个防己茯苓汤，只要他有这个症状，肌肉在那边颤动，我们都会用到防己茯苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164224-ppeeomr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164224-ppeeomr","updated":"20240422164224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以很多处方可以治疗水病，水肿的病，但是你要看清楚，病人是适合哪一个处方。"}]}]}